References, not dependencies
----------------------------

The following projects informed the binding and build design and are not
runtime dependencies:

- Spotify and contributors, pedalboard: Rubber Band single-file compilation,
  offline processing, and platform-specific FFT configuration.
  https://github.com/spotify/pedalboard
- pawel-glomski and contributors, pylibrb: nanobind mappings of
  RubberBandStretcher, including start-delay and preferred-padding APIs.
  https://github.com/pawel-glomski/pylibrb
- gregogiudici and contributors, python-stretch (MIT): Signalsmith nanobind
  integration and latency padding/trimming.
  https://github.com/gregogiudici/python-stretch
- bmcfee and contributors, pyrubberband (ISC): frame-major array behavior,
  API comparison, and early experiments.
  https://github.com/bmcfee/pyrubberband
